{
  "version": "issue-taxonomy-v2",
  "note": "Deterministic issue codes for complaint/cancellation records, assigned at the ranking step (not by a model, not part of any model prompt). Built from the catch-all buckets of the 10,000-review checkpoint (62% of complaints fell into '<topic>.other' under taxonomy-v1). Within the record's primary topic, rules are tried IN ORDER and the first whose case-insensitive regex matches the review text wins; no match gives '<topic>.other'. Changing this file changes only issue membership and ranking, never the stored labels.",
